%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E9%9F%B3%E9%A2%91id%EF%BC%88audio_id%EF%BC%89%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-8SmWThYM%5C%22%3E%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E4%B8%A4%E6%AD%A5%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E3%80%81%E9%9F%B3%E9%A2%91id%E5%A1%91%E9%80%A0%E5%9B%BE%E6%96%87%EF%BC%8C%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%82%E5%9B%BE%E6%96%87mid%E3%80%82%3Cspan%20style%3D%5C%22color%3A%20%23f5222d%3B%5C%22%3E%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%8F%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%BE%E6%96%87mid%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%B3%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E5%BA%94%E7%AD%94%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84carousel_id%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FXzDQefU\">利用图片和音频塑造图文。图文是一种创意内容体裁，在包含多张图片和一段背景音乐，支持自动轮播图片。利用MAPI创建图文素材，需首先获取图文素材内的图片/音频id</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-aHMQcB1V\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-pNbplE9H\">通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1697466652499972\" target=\"_blank\">上传营销图片</a>接口按顺序上传图文素材中的图片，获取图片id；</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-eLponR6E\">通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1828283066050826\" target=\"_blank\">上传图文内音频素材</a>接口上传音频（audio_file或audio_url），获取音频id（audio_id）</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-8SmWThYM\">利用上述两步的图片、音频id塑造图文，获取出参图文mid。<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">不同图片顺序对应不同的图文mid（即接口应答参数中的carousel_id）。</span></p></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201771285485200384%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201748264006369288%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-KTCbmZP5\" id=\"h346b9f0-IK0hIEPo\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-KZVHC20j\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/carousel/create/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/carousel/create/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1828282864020170\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1839622960207943\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-7FLPZjXv\" id=\"h346b9f0-2sWk8NO4\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-DEfFEE5z\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-K24xoQoo\" id=\"h346b9f0-q4SoISnT\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-xfAPCJb0\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-UyBRUi3x\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-I4fVginV\" id=\"h346b9f0-KNaUXEAH\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PiB0kRvj\">客户id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">images</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-04ggn7tB\">图片信息</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">image_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YUTT7Y9k\">图片id，根据<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1697466652499972\" target=\"_blank\">上传营销图片</a>接口获取</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-8DQ2YZX4\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-kZLS8G3W\">9:16&lt;=图片尺寸（宽高比）&lt;=16:9</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-b4JOhaPB\">图片格式约束 <strong>jpg、jpeg、png</strong></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-h6beXFbU\"><strong></strong>图片width约束[360，2560]</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cqlT9a8N\">单个图片不超过10M</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">audio_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YOQtqBhs\">音频id，根据<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1828283066050826\" target=\"_blank\">「上传图文内的音频素材」</a>接口获取</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-0rg9l0RD\">非必填，不传系统将自动匹配一段纯音乐</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">file_name</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ochi0wxT\">图文标题，可自定义图文素材名</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-qSroKK4Q\">不传则默认取第一张图片的名称，最长255个字符</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">description</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-zy0Aecmr\">描述</p></section></section></section>